      en: 'Functional MVP delivered in up to 3 weeks to validate your idea with users. Includes authentication, 1 to 3 main product flows, database, production deploy and clean code. Not a Figma prototype — it is a product that runs, that the user can use and pay for. Ideal for founders who need traction before raising investment or hiring a large team.',
